  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Tulip versus sunflower. A fight to the death. Nobody saw the winner coming.",
      "note": "",
      "events": [
        {
          "cue": "$end",
          "kind": "fight"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunflower strikes first. Solar beam. It's been charging all day.",
      "note": "Young sunflowers really do track the sun across the sky",
      "events": [
        {
          "cue": "solar",
          "kind": "move",
          "who": "R",
          "name": "SOLAR BEAM"
        },
        {
          "cue": "beam",
          "kind": "beam",
          "who": "R",
          "dmg": 35
        }
      ],
      "pause": 0.55
    },
    {
      "text": "But in sixteen thirty-seven, one tulip bulb cost as much as a house. So tulip makes it rain.",
      "note": "Dutch tulip mania, 1637: rare bulbs reportedly sold for the price of a canal house",
      "events": [
        {
          "cue": "bulb",
          "kind": "stat",
          "text": "1 BULB = 1 HOUSE"
        },
        {
          "cue": "so",
          "kind": "move",
          "who": "L",
          "name": "TULIP MANIA"
        },
        {
          "cue": "rain",
          "kind": "coins",
          "who": "L",
          "dmg": 40
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunflower reloads. Two thousand seeds. Full auto.",
      "note": "One sunflower head can hold up to ~2,000 seeds",
      "events": [
        {
          "cue": "two",
          "kind": "move",
          "who": "R",
          "name": "SEED BARRAGE"
        },
        {
          "cue": "full",
          "kind": "seeds",
          "who": "R",
          "dmg": 50
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tulip should be dead. But cut tulips keep growing. So it just gets bigger.",
      "note": "Cut tulips keep growing in the vase, often an inch or more",
      "events": [
        {
          "cue": "but",
          "kind": "move",
          "who": "L",
          "name": "STILL GROWING"
        },
        {
          "cue": "growing",
          "kind": "grow",
          "who": "L"
        },
        {
          "cue": "bigger",
          "kind": "stomp",
          "who": "L",
          "dmg": 40
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunflower turns to the sun for one last blast. And the sun sets.",
      "note": "No sun, no solar beam",
      "pause": 0.2,
      "events": [
        {
          "cue": "turns",
          "kind": "shrink",
          "who": "L"
        },
        {
          "cue": "turns",
          "kind": "charge",
          "who": "R"
        },
        {
          "cue": "sets",
          "kind": "sunset"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then a deer walks in. Deer love tulips.",
      "note": "Gardeners call tulips deer candy",
      "pause": 0.5,
      "events": [
        {
          "cue": "deer",
          "kind": "deer"
        },
        {
          "cue": "love",
          "kind": "chomp",
          "target": "L"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunflower wins! Then the deer looks up.",
      "note": "Deer eat sunflowers too",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "events": [
        {
          "cue": "sunflower",
          "kind": "banner",
          "text": "SUNFLOWER WINS!",
          "who": "R"
        },
        {
          "cue": "looks",
          "kind": "deerTurn"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Winner? The deer.",
      "note": "",
